    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d679">

                <pb facs="0913" n="803" xml:id="pg803"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">871.63/41</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Culbertson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-04-13"><hi rendition="#italic">April 13,
                        1928</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received April 30.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 572</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my telegram No. 16 of April
                    11, 1928, 11 a.m.,<anchor n="9" xml:id="d679-f1"/> stating that the Standard Oil
                    subsidiary (Romano-Americana) had accepted the proposal of the Rumanian
                    Government for the settlement of the dispute concerning the subsoil rights of
                    embatic lands, I have the honor to transmit herewith two documents prepared by
                    the Romano-Americana: (enclosure No. 1) a memorandum reviewing the history of
                    this case, and (enclosure No. 2) the draft convention between the
                    Romano-Americana and the Rumanian State embodying the settlement. This
                    convention, on account of the Easter holidays, has not been actually signed, but
                    no reason exists, so far as I know, why it will not be signed in the immediate
                    future.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed>W. S. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Culbertson</hi></signed></closer>





                <xi:include href="d679-a1.xml" xpointer="d679-a1"/>
